    <item>
      <title>闫俊杰：从AI求索者到“每个人的AI”布道者</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/aiai-20250727224005354-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 27 Jul 2025 22:40:05 +0800</pubDate>
